ANetBBS v1.0a2.116 - Modern BBS System
-----------------------------------------
Web (Flask+SocketIO), telnet, SSH, rlogin,
FTP front-ends sharing one user database.
FidoNet BinkP echomail/netmail. DOVE-Net
QWK. Inter-BBS IM via MSP+SYSTAT. MRC
chat. LORD pre-installed (Synchronet JS).
In-browser DOS games: DOOM + Duke Nukem
3D (shareware) via EmulatorJS/dosbox_pure
-- play classics right in the browser!
Built-in wiki, RSS reader, 80x25 web
terminal. Synchronet .js + Mystic .mps +
DOSBox doors + door32. Sysop NodeSpy.
CP437/ANSI throughout. Native Linux doors
(RMDoor/DDPlus/FPC) work via STDIO mode.
Linux + Python 3.10+ - ./install.sh
github.com/anetonline    By StingRay
